  ['Choose a business model','Decide how the business creates, delivers and captures value.','Compare revenue models, channels, customer relationships, key resources, partners, costs and trade-offs.','business model design'],
  ['Hire and organise a team','Work out which roles are needed and how the team should operate.','Identify capabilities, role sequencing, workload, employment considerations, onboarding and performance measures.','team and capability planning'],
  ['Expand to a new location or market','Grow beyond the initial customer base, outlet or geography.','Assess repeatability, demand, local adaptation, management capacity, capital needs and expansion risks.','business expansion'],
  ['Improve an underperforming operation','The business is operating but has delays, waste, quality problems or inconsistent service.','Diagnose root causes, map processes, identify constraints and prioritise measurable improvements.','operational improvement']
